&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s Point of Sale (POS) solution helps cafes, shops, bars, hair salons, and thousands of other businesses manage their day-to-day operations. Alongside the POS experience, merchants rely on powerful reporting, sales management, and fiscalisation tools to understand their business, stay compliant, and operate with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role would own these three domains from a design perspective - Reporting, Sales, and Fiscalisation. You&#39;ll design the experiences merchants use to analyse performance, manage sales activity, and navigate local fiscal requirements, while helping shape a more unified reporting experience across SumUp&#39;s payments, banking, and commerce products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with product managers, engineers, and data teams within POS, and collaborate with designers and stakeholders across SumUp to deliver experiences that are clear, trustworthy, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎬 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;Take a look at our Berlin office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end design across Reporting, Fiscalisation, and Sales domains - from discovery and strategy through to production-ready delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the unification of reporting experiences across Dashboard and Mobile, making complex data clear and accessible for merchants&lt;/li&gt;
